{
  "description": "Choice of the values sent at each tick. Input: mode (onChange or everyTick) and ticks, each with ts, the values measured at that tick (raw, before rounding), and optionally selectionChanged. All keys that appear are selected; transmission is switched on just before the first tick. Expected: sent, the samples handed to the offline queue, with rounded values. A tick without a sample does not appear. See sensors.md, Sending on change.",
